{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bandage_roll","model_identifier":"bandage_roll","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## bandage_roll\n\nMedicine prop.\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 16x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.5..1.5, y -4.0..1.5, z -1.3..1.2 (size 3.0 x 5.5 x 2.5 u = 8 x 15 x 7 cm).\nBandage roll: a roll of clean linen bandage (~10 cm, exaggerated a little) with a loose tail hanging down; the spiral shows on both ends. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 4.0.\n"},"description":"## bandage_roll\n\nMedicine prop.\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 16x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.5..1.5, y -4.0..1.5, z -1.3..1.2 (size 3.0 x 5.5 x 2.5 u = 8 x 15 x 7 cm).\nBandage roll: a roll of clean linen bandage (~10 cm, exaggerated a little) with a loose tail hanging down; the spiral shows on both ends. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 4.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"roll","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,-1.0,-1.25],"to":[1.5,1.0,1.25],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[9,3,12.0,5.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[12,3,14.5,5.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,6,3.0,8.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[3,6,5.5,8.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,3.0,2.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[3,0,6.0,2.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0ade3352-34ef-5411-afbf-7b024cc4a87c"},{"name":"roll_x","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from